{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1437021-environmental-tilts-and-uratha-regeneration","id":1437021,"title":"Environmental Tilts and Uratha Regeneration","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-02-25T11:47:57-08:00","id":1437021,"title":"Environmental Tilts and Uratha Regeneration","content":"I just realized a little blurb in the section of Environmental tilts that someone cannot heal until they leave the conditions causing the tilt. Does that also apply to the crazy regeneration of the Uratha? Since some powers have the ability to inflict Environmental tilts (like one of the Claimed in the book Shunned by the Moon), would this be a legit way to bypass regeneration?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1107-maryshelly","name":"maryshelly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1107_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-25T11:52:16-08:00","id":1437022,"title":"","content":"Unless it specifically calls it out, no, it wouldn't impede the supernatural regeneration of Uratha.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com